<rss version="2.0" xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/"><channel><title>TWZ</title><link>https://www.twz.com</link><description>防御世界的强大进攻。</description><lastBuildDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 20:59:46 GMT</lastBuildDate><generator>rfeed v1.1.1</generator><docs>https://github.com/svpino/rfeed/blob/master/README.md</docs><item><title>地堡谈话：享受神奇的火鸡日版！</title><link>https://www.twz.com/news-features/bunker-talk-have-a-magical-turkey-day-edition</link><description>&lt;p&gt;我们还有最后一罐蔓越莓酱......&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.twz.com/news-features/bunker-talk-have-a-magical-turkey-day-edition"&gt;地堡后谈话：度过一个神奇的火鸡日版！&lt;/a&gt;首先出现在&lt;a href="https://www.twz.com"&gt;TWZ&lt;/a&gt;上。&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 21:26:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.twz.com/news-features/bunker-talk-have-a-magical-turkey-day-edition</guid></item><item><title>无人机威胁促使英国皇家空军在基地安装防护网以保护飞机：报告</title><link>https://www.twz.com/news-features/drone-threats-prompt-raf-to-install-netting-at-bases-to-protect-aircraft-reports</link><description>&lt;p&gt;由于美国及其盟国越来越担心无人机对停放的飞机造成危险，因此安装了这种防护网。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt; &lt;a href="https://www.twz.com/news-features/drone-threats-prompt-raf-to-install-netting-at-bases-to-protect-aircraft-reports"&gt;无人机威胁促使英国皇家空军在基地安装防护网以保护飞机：报告&lt;/a&gt;首先出现在&lt;a href="https://www.twz.com"&gt;TWZ&lt;/a&gt;上。&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 20:47:03 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.twz.com/news-features/drone-threats-prompt-raf-to-install-netting-at-bases-to-protect-aircraft-reports</guid></item><item><title>美国空军根据与波音公司的原始合同订购了最后一批 KC-46 加油机</title><link>https://www.twz.com/air/final-kc-46-tankers-under-original-contract-with-boeing-ordered-by-usaf</link><description>&lt;p&gt;由于不确定性影响其下一代空中加油愿景，美国空军计划最终在已订购的 188 架基础上再购买 75 架 KC-46。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt; &lt;a href="https://www.twz.com/air/final-kc-46-tankers-under-original-contract-with-boeing-ordered-by-usaf"&gt;美国空军与波音公司订购的最终 KC-46 加油机最终合同&lt;/a&gt;首先出现在&lt;a href="https://www.twz.com"&gt;TWZ&lt;/a&gt;上。&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 19:28:11 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.twz.com/air/final-kc-46-tankers-under-original-contract-with-boeing-ordered-by-usaf</guid></item><item><title>ARRW高超音速导弹变型舰艇杀伤力极强，难以获得立法者的全力支持</title><link>https://www.twz.com/air/ship-killing-arrw-hypersonic-missile-variant-struggling-to-get-full-support-from-lawmakers</link><description>&lt;p&gt;参议员们还计划削减新的空射弹道导弹计划的资金投入。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt; &lt;a href="https://www.twz.com/air/ship-killing-arrw-hypersonic-missile-variant-struggling-to-get-full-support-from-lawmakers"&gt;杀舰后的 ARRW 高超音速导弹变体努力获得立法者的全力支持，&lt;/a&gt;首先出现在&lt;a href="https://www.twz.com"&gt;TWZ&lt;/a&gt;上。&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 18:04:27 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.twz.com/air/ship-killing-arrw-hypersonic-missile-variant-struggling-to-get-full-support-from-lawmakers</guid></item><item><title>新型 W8000 助力中国货运无人机不断发展壮大</title><link>https://www.twz.com/air/chinas-cargo-drones-keep-getting-bigger-with-new-w8000</link><description>&lt;p&gt;随着中国推进新型自主空运，白鲸航空最新的无人驾驶货机是迄今为止最大的，目标是运输八吨货物。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;文章&lt;a href="https://www.twz.com/air/chinas-cargo-drones-keep-getting-bigger-with-new-w8000"&gt;《中国货运无人机凭借新型 W8000 不断变大》&lt;/a&gt;首先出现在&lt;a href="https://www.twz.com"&gt;TWZ&lt;/a&gt;上。&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 17:50:12 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.twz.com/air/chinas-cargo-drones-keep-getting-bigger-with-new-w8000</guid></item><item><title>新抵达乌克兰的山猫KF41战车将承担反无人机任务</title><link>https://www.twz.com/land/lynx-kf41-fighting-vehicles-newly-arrived-in-ukraine-will-take-on-counter-drone-mission</link><description>&lt;p&gt;德国制造的车辆抵达乌克兰时，装甲的作用已大大减弱，但并未消除。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;最新抵达&lt;a href="https://www.twz.com"&gt;乌克兰&lt;/a&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.twz.com/land/lynx-kf41-fighting-vehicles-newly-arrived-in-ukraine-will-take-on-counter-drone-mission"&gt;的山猫 KF41 战车将承担反无人机任务&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Tue, 24 Nov 2026 22:39:54 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.twz.com/land/lynx-kf41-fighting-vehicles-newly-arrived-in-ukraine-will-take-on-counter-drone-mission</guid></item><item><title>俄罗斯战机几秒钟内就进入韩国领空，首尔紧急升空 F-15K</title><link>https://www.twz.com/air/seoul-scrambles-f-15ks-as-russian-warplanes-come-within-seconds-of-crossing-into-south-korean-airspace</link><description>&lt;p&gt;俄罗斯 Tu-160 和护航战斗机​​的出现引发了韩国居民的避难令。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt; &lt;a href="https://www.twz.com/air/seoul-scrambles-f-15ks-as-russian-warplanes-come-within-seconds-of-crossing-into-south-korean-airspace"&gt;当俄罗斯战机在几秒钟内进入韩国领空时，首尔紧急升空 F-15K 的&lt;/a&gt;报道首先出现在&lt;a href="https://www.twz.com"&gt;TWZ&lt;/a&gt;上。&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Tue, 24 Nov 2026 21:24:50 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.twz.com/air/seoul-scrambles-f-15ks-as-russian-warplanes-come-within-seconds-of-crossing-into-south-korean-airspace</guid></item><item><title>FireAnt Mini无人地面车辆在美国陆军测试中部署无人机检测传感器</title><link>https://www.twz.com/land/fireant-mini-uncrewed-ground-vehicles-deploy-drone-detection-sensors-in-u-s-army-test</link><description>&lt;p&gt;陆军明确要求将传感器放置在非常敌对的前沿区域，像 FireAnt 这样的小型机器人可能会提供巨大的帮助。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt; &lt;a href="https://www.twz.com/land/fireant-mini-uncrewed-ground-vehicles-deploy-drone-detection-sensors-in-u-s-army-test"&gt;FireAnt 迷你无人地面车辆在美国陆军测试中部署无人机检测传感器的&lt;/a&gt;帖子首先出现在&lt;a href="https://www.twz.com"&gt;TWZ&lt;/a&gt;上。&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Tue, 24 Nov 2026 19:19:27 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.twz.com/land/fireant-mini-uncrewed-ground-vehicles-deploy-drone-detection-sensors-in-u-s-army-test</guid></item><item><title>瑞典鹰狮在波兰以小足迹做大事</title><link>https://www.twz.com/air/swedens-tiny-gripen-fighter-detachment-takes-on-a-big-nato-role</link><description>&lt;p&gt;瑞典正在将其分散的战斗机行动扩展到整个北约，波兰的袖珍前沿支援部队正在编写剧本。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt; &lt;a href="https://www.twz.com/air/swedens-tiny-gripen-fighter-detachment-takes-on-a-big-nato-role"&gt;瑞典鹰狮在波兰以微小的足迹做大事的&lt;/a&gt;帖子首先出现在&lt;a href="https://www.twz.com"&gt;TWZ&lt;/a&gt;上。&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Tue, 24 Nov 2026 18:34:08 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.twz.com/air/swedens-tiny-gripen-fighter-detachment-takes-on-a-big-nato-role</guid></item><item><title>土耳其克孜勒马战斗机无人机宣布投入运行</title><link>https://www.twz.com/air/turkish-kizilelma-fighter-drone-declared-operational</link><description>&lt;p&gt;巴伊卡很早就加入了“战斗机无人机”阵营，目前多个空军部队正在全球范围内寻求类似的能力。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.twz.com/air/turkish-kizilelma-fighter-drone-declared-operational"&gt;土耳其克孜勒马战斗机无人机宣布投入运行后&lt;/a&gt;首先出现在&lt;a href="https://www.twz.com"&gt;TWZ&lt;/a&gt;上。&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Tue, 24 Nov 2026 18:10:10 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.twz.com/air/turkish-kizilelma-fighter-drone-declared-operational</guid></item></channel></rss>